From 57345a173e226d427a6eedbd5ba14a64a5a66613 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lcy <admin@luchenyang.xyz>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:05:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] CarrierConfig: rothko voice capability snapshot and checked
 dump

Publishes the vendor carrier voice capability snapshot used by the rothko
IMS integration and adds a permission-checked dump of it (DUMP required for
remote callers).
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           |   4 +-
 .../DefaultCarrierConfigService.java          | 258 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 255 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

